accTitle: Backup connectivity must survive loss of the primary circuit
accDescr: The data center reaches AWS through a preferred Direct Connect path or an independently routed internet VPN. The backup does not depend on the primary physical circuit.
D[Data center router]:::external -->|Preferred route| X[Direct Connect circuit]:::process
D -->|Backup route| I[Independent internet service]:::external
I --> V[Site-to-Site VPN]:::process
X --> A[AWS private network]:::output
V --> A
F[DX failure withdraws preferred route]:::warning -.-> D
L[Backup has reduced performance]:::reference -.-> V
